{{!
    @template local_dataforge/fields/value/html

    This template renders the html display of a value.

    This renders HTML rather than sanitised data, for fields that need things like tables, so ensure that all
    data is sanitised before it is passed to this template.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "value": "This is the value"
    }
}}
<div>{{{value}}}</div>
